    {
      "block_id": "page-0898-block-0003",
      "order": 3,
      "text": "Amisulpride48–50\nModerate\nAround 16g.\nQT prolongation, arrhythmia, cardiac arrest.\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.039398193359375,
        257.46978759765625,
        413.8267822265625,
        266.1797790527344
      ],
      "text_sha256": "ea6d05bb2f43a7686c05b3193d6adf6b40d9664f09ca6eabafc31fae46e45af2"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0898-block-0004",
      "order": 4,
      "text": "Aripiprazole51–53\nLow\nUnclear.\nFatality unlikely when taken alone.\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.036895751953125,
        272.4922790527344,
        273.8094177246094,
        291.1996765136719
      ],
      "text_sha256": "92eb2caf1693f256a72f6c1d62efcc8be12487fdc8bf5beb076f253d28b3974c"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0898-block-0005",
      "order": 5,
      "text": "Sedation, lethargy, GI disturbance, \ndrooling.\n",
      "bbox": [
        280.0343933105469,
        272.49468994140625,
        391.8594665527344,
        291.1996765136719
      ],
      "text_sha256": "78f70c2f6ed557cf308484f0590bc9ea8ab0f282a2a14273d78360a3b3ddab2f"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0898-block-0006",
      "order": 6,
      "text": "Asenapine54\nProbably \nlow\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.036895751953125,
        297.5146789550781,
        157.4918975830078,
        316.2247009277344
      ],
      "text_sha256": "8270f92a62b61599d8a52f3a8db722934de5ef2e26a4bc106193ea33f9f1d460"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0898-block-0007",
      "order": 7,
      "text": "Unclear. No deaths from \noverdose reported. Oral \nabsorption very limited.\n",
      "bbox": [
        171.03689575195312,
        297.51971435546875,
        250.64190673828125,
        326.2221984863281
      ],
      "text_sha256": "641ca9b2009b36ca12f916302febbdff01351fa6825ab43c89f0c740cc541121"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0898-block-0008",
      "order": 8,
      "text": "Sedation, confusion, facial dystonia, \nbenign ECG changes.\n",
      "bbox": [
        280.0343933105469,
        297.51220703125,
        397.1394958496094,
        316.2171936035156
      ],
      "text_sha256": "d2190fcf99f4aef3e4941614aa41aee3a1919601a471047c88fc57133dc56b5d"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0898-block-0009",
      "order": 9,
      "text": "Brexpiprazole55\nProbably \nlow\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.036895751953125,
        332.5372009277344,
        157.4918975830078,
        351.2497863769531
      ],
      "text_sha256": "7459d3f95b5e5cc3cad5f7ddc521f9c1e4c170a4ac8d549d6727e60acf358091"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0898-block-0010",
      "order": 10,
      "text": "No information available.\nPresumably agitation and nausea?\n",
      "bbox": [
        171.03689575195312,
        332.5447998046875,
        389.08447265625,
        341.2522888183594
      ],
      "text_sha256": "83704394a1d8658776b0b303aadc6af79c1531e0591508cd9bd1ae11e8737c50"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0898-block-0011",
      "order": 11,
      "text": "Butyrophenones56–58\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.036895751953125,
        357.5722961425781,
        111.91727447509766,
        366.27978515625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "5dd1b9fa945af71480316045021fdd1c1631964e1dcd969659a55ee523cb0f25"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0898-block-0012",
      "order": 12,
      "text": "(e.g. haloperidol)\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.039398193359375,
        367.5697937011719,
        102.22689056396484,
        376.27728271484375
      ],
      "text_sha256": "fbdf029316caf435270432b1381b71831412f066e78152904547d9832eb994a8"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0898-block-0013",
      "order": 13,
      "text": "Moderate\nHaloperidol – probably above \n500mg.\nArrhythmia may occur at  \n300mg.\n",
      "bbox": [
        128.04190063476562,
        357.5722961425781,
        266.7618408203125,
        396.27227783203125
      ],
      "text_sha256": "4cb73e0dbb7d66a6fad4654e25d3cce897f0aad4958c374ef6db56d2e79b21f9"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0898-block-0014",
      "order": 14,
      "text": "Sedation, coma, dystonia, NMS, QT \nprolongation, arrhythmia.\n",
      "bbox": [
        280.0368957519531,
        357.5647888183594,
        395.4769287109375,
        376.269775390625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "6a882dee7bba86e051cd1bc78032a4d0bf770231749372a6b57c0908b657646b"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0898-block-0015",
      "order": 15,
      "text": "Cariprazine59\nLow\nEU SPC reports one overdose  \nof 48mg.\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.039398193359375,
        402.5872802734375,
        267.8769226074219,
        421.2997741699219
      ],
      "text_sha256": "98964fef4b155b8853c6516c300d13c9643de1db75556d9842c010883db3e04e"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0898-block-0016",
      "order": 16,
      "text": "Sedation, low blood pressure.\n",
      "bbox": [
        280.0343933105469,
        402.59478759765625,
        374.7969970703125,
        411.3022766113281
      ],
      "text_sha256": "58508cf8abded1238309d1ffa2cd97f0c2ff7c9777d8da4740866c4d30f01e03"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0898-block-0017",
      "order": 17,
      "text": "Clozapine60,61\nModerate\nAround 2g; much lower in \nthose not tolerant to its \neffects.62\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.036895751953125,
        427.61968994140625,
        257.6018981933594,
        456.3221740722656
      ],
      "text_sha256": "5bc499c5050d9d5b51a82bc9af3ef610cc9c0522fee28e5a87e3bc3883f047eb"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0898-block-0018",
      "order": 18,
      "text": "Lethargy, coma, tachycardia, hypotension, \nhypersalivation, pneumonia, seizures.\n",
      "bbox": [
        280.0393981933594,
        427.61968994140625,
        416.12689208984375,
        446.3246765136719
      ],
      "text_sha256": "5c978cc1261566aa89199962157d6c83781558ba096e125cf5f6147d32191372"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0898-block-0019",
      "order": 19,
      "text": "Iloperidone63–65\nProbably \nmoderate\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.041900634765625,
        462.6446838378906,
        158.87188720703125,
        481.34979248046875
      ],
      "text_sha256": "e2362f9550d3259dc4b0bcc63a32cc3eab74ab76d0d50233c713c129d6a29f1b"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0898-block-0020",
      "order": 20,
      "text": "Unclear but probably more than \n500mg.\nPotent effect on QT interval. Sedation, \ntachycardia, respiratory depression, \nhypotension likely.\n",
      "bbox": [
        171.03689575195312,
        462.6448059082031,
        404.4894104003906,
        491.3472900390625
      ],
      "text_sha256": "e7b915c12410ab12af18458074cd1dc393ba149287996c17282df49f68f6e714"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0898-block-0021",
      "order": 21,
      "text": "Lumateperone66\nProbably \nlow\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.036895751953125,
        497.6623229980469,
        157.4918975830078,
        516.374755859375
      ],
      "text_sha256": "58e6a83aca8c0163b2ad5c47e74ee0c80753538342af1d5b4a6e25f9a7460bc8"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0898-block-0022",
      "order": 22,
      "text": "No overdoses reported.\nPresumably sedation and dizziness?\n",
      "bbox": [
        171.03689575195312,
        497.6697998046875,
        393.24700927734375,
        506.3772888183594
      ],
      "text_sha256": "a5b5c8d9719f9144536f2bf7c4c5e4000e92fb02881c7ab0b96fba69d99046b6"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0898-block-0023",
      "order": 23,
      "text": "Lurasidone67\nLow\nUnclear. An overdose of \n1360mg was not fatal.68 One \nstudy reported no deaths in 821 \nexposures.24\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.036895751953125,
        522.6947631835938,
        275.943603515625,
        561.3972778320312
      ],
      "text_sha256": "93cc15a70fb08c59330e45a4a8daacb692a1b2fe324cec7e1fa6a322b471a850"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0898-block-0024",
      "order": 24,
      "text": "Very limited information. Minimal effect \non QT interval.\n",
      "bbox": [
        280.0393981933594,
        522.6947631835938,
        409.47442626953125,
        541.3997802734375
      ],
      "text_sha256": "21ffb698cf01db106b9bb062592a9d9558a0caf5d1c486f94b69e2ad6d5f1d56"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0898-block-0025",
      "order": 25,
      "text": "Olanzapine60,69–71\nModerate\nUnclear. Probably substantially \nmore than 200mg.\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.041900634765625,
        570.8147583007812,
        269.3843688964844,
        589.5247802734375
      ],
      "text_sha256": "ecbdd45c6b48a4a4911f07b5f303c009ec377d58b0a42278f9173664e7102d2e"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0898-block-0026",
      "order": 26,
      "text": "Lethargy, confusion, myoclonus, \nmyopathy, hypotension, tachycardia, \ndelirium. Possibly QT prolongation.\n",
      "bbox": [
        280.0343933105469,
        570.8197631835938,
        398.8044128417969,
        599.5222778320312
      ],
      "text_sha256": "5e9e9f83103484c3e6b5ed900a9d6e7e3016469dff1e817b375f2ab1ebd164f7"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0898-block-0027",
      "order": 27,
      "text": "Drug or drug group\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.039398193359375,
        99.78968811035156,
        117.06937408447266,
        108.67718505859375
      ],
      "text_sha256": "d528646a4477039c6bdce1cc5da8ca2b45d7d96730efadb8e0e467171afacd39"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0898-block-0028",
      "order": 28,
      "text": "Toxicity in \noverdose\n",
      "bbox": [
        128.04190063476562,
        89.79219055175781,
        165.5569305419922,
        108.67718505859375
      ],
      "text_sha256": "51ebed65665cfe44e710fb62a313d80f26f929956df51247961e3b5d5f90dcd5"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0898-block-0029",
      "order": 29,
      "text": "Smallest dose likely  \nto cause death\nSigns and symptoms of overdose\n",
      "bbox": [
        171.03939819335938,
        89.79219055175781,
        396.5793151855469,
        108.67718505859375
      ],
      "text_sha256": "6209e6f36b542e07025e47df7227bdb6e50dfc25f07e27e2d9a5fe9d6ac1c0f2"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0898-block-0030",
      "order": 30,
      "text": "Venlafaxine3,41–43 \n(desvenlafaxine causes \nsimilar effects but may \nbe less toxic44)\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.039398193359375,
        119.84468841552734,
        122.05879211425781,
        158.55218505859375
      ],
      "text_sha256": "7bdc36a4f5c90ac14db6a09bce0c55faf766f0336a9944a84ca688a60df14a2f"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0898-block-0031",
      "order": 31,
      "text": "Moderate\nProbably above 5g, but seizures \nmay occur after ingestion of 1g.\n",
      "bbox": [
        128.03590393066406,
        119.84468841552734,
        272.32086181640625,
        138.5496826171875
      ],
      "text_sha256": "f1165e14b2bc5919cc55bb309368407802dc2e6fcd39e8f7fbc3d2df751ad510"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0898-block-0032",
      "order": 32,
      "text": "Vomiting, sedation, tachycardia, \nhypertension, seizures, acidosis. Rarely QT \nprolongation, arrhythmia, \nrhabdomyolysis. Very rarely cardiac arrest/\nMI, heart failure.\n",
      "bbox": [
        280.0308837890625,
        119.84468841552734,
        415.60845947265625,
        168.54217529296875
      ],
      "text_sha256": "9e8c8f77e87d6023c36babecb06068ec67e4313ab8cf9ec428ee9c04a738e59e"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0898-block-0033",
      "order": 33,
      "text": "Vilazodone45,46\nLow\nDoses below 300mg are not \nfatal. No fatalities recorded in \n714 exposures.24\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.03338623046875,
        174.85716247558594,
        267.43438720703125,
        203.57217407226562
      ],
      "text_sha256": "744db5da5cc7fdf6e5d4f1b98014468a47ebea6f64945d2304e48804a2f19039"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0898-block-0034",
      "order": 34,
      "text": "Drowsiness, agitation, vomiting, seizures.\n",
      "bbox": [
        280.0393981933594,
        174.8696746826172,
        411.4544982910156,
        183.57717895507812
      ],
      "text_sha256": "c1b55b8a3ab02d2291e97275224588e9cb0ad979ad540669bd071fe7c37cadde"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0898-block-0035",
      "order": 35,
      "text": "Vortioxetine47\nLow\nUnclear. An overdose of 250mg \ncaused no symptoms.\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.041900634765625,
